00:58:27.320 --> 00:58:31.720
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. What does it mean that he greets me every day with,
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督：托里·马拉蒂亚。他每天用这句话迎接我，这到底意味着什么？

00:58:31.720 --> 00:58:35.900
<v Matt Malloy>Good morning. You are the 100% perfect girl for me.
<v Matt Malloy>“早上好。你是我的百分之百完美女孩。”

00:58:35.900 --> 00:58:56.540
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:56.540 --> 00:59:01.540
